    "sections": {
        "description": "The Home Styling Interior theme is a sleek and modern interior design website template tailored for designers, decorators, stylists, and home improvement experts. Perfect for a home decor website, interior design studio website, or furniture and home styling brand, it offers a professional digital presence to showcase your creativity. Whether you specialize in Modern Home Styling Templates, Luxury Interior Design Websites, or home renovation and decor templates, this theme adapts seamlessly to all aesthetics—from small apartments to expansive villa interiors. With full-width banners, interactive galleries, testimonial sliders, and a stylish blog layout, it’s ideal for presenting room makeovers, decor concepts, and design inspiration. The theme is perfect for interior architecture website designs, Residential Interior Design Portfolio, or even contemporary home designs. Its elegant portfolio sections let you display kitchen and bathroom styling, living room styling, or curated office and workspace interior design projects. Clean typography, responsive sliders, and retina-ready visuals ensure your work shines across all devices. For businesses like a home furnishing store design or individuals focusing on Minimalist Home Decor Theme, this theme provides flexibility to personalize every section. Showcase vintage aesthetics, Eco-Friendly Interior Design Website features, or statement walls with bold lighting—your creative vision comes to life effortlessly. Compatible with Gutenberg and major page builders, the Home Styling Interior theme is user-friendly yet professional. Whether you’re a freelancer, a design studio, or a blogger sharing kitchen and bathroom styling tips, this template gives you everything needed to create a stunning, high-converting online presence."
    },
